 "proposals": [
  {
   "id": "mi-26025-city-of-albion-proposal",
   "title": "City of Albion Proposal",
   "where": "Calhoun County",
   "scope": {
    "county": true
   },
   "text": "PROPOSED AMENDMENT TO SECTION 10.6(a) OF THE CHARTER OF THE CITY OF ALBION Section 10.6(a) requires the board of review to be composed of four (4) taxpayers of the city who have the qualifications for holding elective city office. The amendment would: (1) change the total board of review membership to three (3) taxpayers of the city who have the qualifications for holding elective city office. Should this proposal be adopted? PROPOSED AMENDMENT TO SECTION 7.2 OF THE CHARTER OF THE CITY OF ALBION Section 7.2 requires the city manager to hold a bachelor ’ s degree and at least a master ’ s degree in public administration or equivalent. The amendment would: (1) remove the master ’ s degree requirement and replace it with a minimum of ten (10) years of public administration experience. Should this proposal be adopted? 9/8/2026 4:33:32 PM"
